Description: Console Wall dashboard for Proxmox VE
 Adds a Console Wall view under Datacenter that displays many live noVNC
 guest consoles in a configurable grid (2x2, 3x3, 4x4, custom or auto).
 .
 Features live CPU/RAM/network overlays, health-coloured borders, VM search
 and filtering by node and tag, interactive or read-only mode, per-guest
 quick actions (start, stop, reset, shutdown, snapshot), full-screen console,
 saved layouts and auto-rotation. All authentication, ACLs and console
 streaming reuse the native Proxmox VE APIs.
